      771   DEFINE FRAME DLGOKCAN
      772        B-quit AT ROW 1 COL 1
      773        B-exit AT ROW 1 COL 11
      774        b-help AT ROW 1 COL 61
      775        InExtQnty AT ROW 4.96 COL 25.5
      776        InExtCostSum AT ROW 4.96 COL 36
