      810             SIZE 15.5 BY .75 AT ROW 8.71 COL 4
      811             FGCOLOR 4
      812        "Расход внешний" VIEW-AS TEXT
      813             SIZE 14.5 BY .75 AT ROW 7.46 COL 4
      814             FGCOLOR 4
